    "\n",
    "print(\"环境初始化完成。本节是离线模拟，不依赖 API Key。\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "cell-rubric-md",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 2. 任务与评分标准（Rubric）\n",
    "\n",
    "Reflexion 的前提是有明确的 **Rubric（评分标准）**。\n",
    "没有 rubric，critic 就无法产出可执行的反思——只能给出"答案不够好"这种空话。\n",
    "\n",
    "**好的 rubric 应该：**\n",
    "1. 每个维度独立可验证（能用关键词、规则或 LLM-as-judge 自动检查）\n",
    "2. 覆盖完整性（citation）、安全性（fallback）、质量（evaluation）、格式（concise）\n",
    "3. 维度之间不重叠"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "code-rubric",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# 任务：一个有明确约束的开放性问题\n",
    "TASK = \"用 120 字以内回答：如何降低 RAG Agent 的幻觉？\"\n",
    "\n",
    "# Rubric 是 critic 的「判题规则」——必须精确到可以自动检查，而不是凭感觉打分\n",
    "RUBRIC = {\n",
    "    \"grounding\": \"要求回答必须提到基于检索证据生成，而不是只依赖模型记忆\",\n",
    "    \"citation\":  \"要求回答必须提到引用、证据片段或来源检查\",\n",
    "    \"fallback\":  \"要求回答必须提到检索不足时拒答、追问或降级\",\n",
    "    \"evaluation\":\"要求回答必须提到评估闭环，如 groundedness / faithfulness\",\n",
    "    \"concise\":   \"要求回答不超过 120 个中文字符\",\n",
    "}\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"任务：\", TASK)\n",
    "print()\n",
    "print(\"评分维度（共 5 项）：\")\n",
    "for key, desc in RUBRIC.items():\n",
    "    print(f\"  [{key}] {desc}\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "cell-dataclass-md",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 3. 数据结构设计\n",
    "\n",
    "Reflexion 的轨迹需要结构化存储，便于复盘和调试。\n",
    "\n",
    "```\n",
    "Attempt\n",
    "  ├── turn        # 第几轮\n",
    "  ├── answer      # 本轮的答案\n",
    "  ├── critique    # Critic 的评判结果\n",
    "  │     ├── score    # 分数 0~5\n",
    "  │     ├── missing  # 未满足的维度 key 列表\n",
    "  │     └── notes    # 对应维度的要求说明\n",
    "  └── reflection  # 反思记忆\n",
    "        └── lessons  # 下一轮的可执行约束列表\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "`frozen=True` 让数据不可变——Reflexion 的轨迹是历史记录，不应该被事后修改。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "code-dataclasses",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "@dataclass(frozen=True)\n",
    "class Critique:\n",
    "    \"\"\"Critic 对一次回答的评判结果。frozen=True：不可变，防止事后修改。\"\"\"\n",
    "    score: int          # 0~5 分，满足一个维度 +1\n",
    "    missing: list[str]  # 未满足的 rubric 维度 key 列表\n",
    "    notes: list[str]    # 对应维度的具体要求说明\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "@dataclass(frozen=True)\n",
    "class Reflection:\n",
    "    \"\"\"一轮反思的产物：一批可执行的记忆教训。\"\"\"\n",
    "    # lessons 必须是「下次要检查 X」这样的操作性约束，而不是「下次更认真」这类空话\n",
    "    lessons: list[str]\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "@dataclass(frozen=True)\n",
    "class Attempt:\n",
    "    \"\"\"一轮 Reflexion 的完整记录：答案 + 评判 + 反思，是调试复盘的基础。\"\"\"\n",
    "    turn: int\n",
    "    answer: str\n",
    "    critique: Critique\n",
    "    reflection: Reflection\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"数据结构定义完成：\")\n",
    "print(\"  Critique.missing  → 哪些 rubric 维度没满足\")\n",
    "print(\"  Reflection.lessons → 下一轮的可执行约束\")\n",
    "print(\"  Attempt           → 一轮轨迹的完整快照\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "cell-generator-md",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 4. Generator —— 第一次生成答案\n",
    "\n",
    "Generator 的职责：给定任务，生成第一版答案。\n",
    "\n",
    "生产中这里是一次 LLM 调用。离线练习用硬编码字符串模拟：\n",
    "- 答案方向正确（提到了 RAG 和检索）\n",
    "- 刻意遗漏 citation / fallback / evaluation 三个维度，让 critic 有东西可批"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "code-generator",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "def generate_initial_answer(task: str) -> str:\n",
    "    \"\"\"模拟第一次回答：方向正确，但缺少可验证约束。\"\"\"\n",
    "    # 生产中替换为：response = client.chat.completions.create(...)\n",
    "    return \"降低幻觉要让 Agent 使用 RAG，先检索知识库，再把上下文交给模型回答。\"\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "# 观察初始答案，手动判断哪些 rubric 满足、哪些缺失\n",
    "initial = generate_initial_answer(TASK)\n",
    "print(\"初始答案：\")\n",
    "print(\" \", initial)\n",
    "print(f\"字数：{len(initial)} 字\")\n",
    "print()\n",
    "print(\"你认为这个答案满足了哪几个维度？\")\n",
    "print(\"  grounding (检索/知识库) → 有提到\")\n",
    "print(\"  citation  (引用/来源)   → 没有\")\n",
    "print(\"  fallback  (拒答/降级)   → 没有\")\n",
    "print(\"  evaluation(评估闭环)    → 没有\")\n",
    "print(\"  concise   (120 字以内)  → 满足\")\n",
    "print(\"→ 预期分数：2/5\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "cell-critic-md",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 5. Critic —— 用 Rubric 评判答案\n",
    "\n",
    "Critic 是 Reflexion 的关键组件，它的质量决定了反思是否有价值。\n",
    "\n",
    "**三种常见的 critic 实现：**\n",
    "\n",
    "| 类型 | 实现 | 精度 | 成本 |\n",
    "|------|------|------|------|\n",
    "| 关键词/规则 | `if keyword in answer` | 低（会漏报/误报） | 极低（本节方式）|\n",
    "| LLM-as-judge | 让强模型打分，返回 JSON | 高 | 中（每轮一次 API）|\n",
    "| 结构化评测 | RAGAS / TruLens 等框架 | 最高 | 高（需要 GT 标注）|\n",
    "\n",
    "本练习用关键词匹配，目的是聚焦理解控制流，而不是评测精度。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "code-critic",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "def critique_answer(answer: str) -> Critique:\n",
    "    \"\"\"用确定性 rubric 扮演 critic，避免本练习依赖真实 API。\"\"\"\n",
    "    missing: list[str] = []\n",
    "    notes: list[str] = []\n",
    "\n",
    "    # 每个维度定义一组关键词，满足任意一个即算通过\n",
    "    # 生产中这里可以换成 LLM 打分：critic_prompt + json_mode\n",
    "    checks = {\n",
    "        \"grounding\": [\"证据\", \"检索\", \"上下文\", \"知识库\"],\n",
    "        \"citation\":  [\"引用\", \"来源\", \"证据片段\"],\n",
    "        \"fallback\":  [\"拒答\", \"追问\", \"降级\", \"不足\"],\n",
    "        \"evaluation\":[\"评估\", \"groundedness\", \"faithfulness\", \"回归\"],\n",
    "    }\n",
    "    for key, keywords in checks.items():\n",
    "        if not any(word in answer for word in keywords):\n",
    "            missing.append(key)\n",
    "            notes.append(RUBRIC[key])\n",
    "\n",
    "    if len(answer) > 120:\n",
    "        missing.append(\"concise\")\n",
    "        notes.append(RUBRIC[\"concise\"])\n",
    "\n",
    "    score = max(0, 5 - len(missing))\n",
    "    return Critique(score=score, missing=missing, notes=notes)\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "# 对初始答案进行评判，验证预期\n",
    "initial_critique = critique_answer(initial)\n",
    "print(f\"初始答案评分：{initial_critique.score}/5\")\n",
    "print(f\"缺口维度：    {initial_critique.missing}\")\n",
    "print(\"未通过的维度要求：\")\n",
    "for note in initial_critique.notes:\n",
    "    print(\" -\", note)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "cell-reflect-md",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 6. Reflect —— 把失败改写成可执行记忆\n",
    "\n",
    "**这是 Reflexion 和普通重试的本质区别。**\n",
    "\n",
    "- 普通重试：「模型你再想想」→ 没有新信息，输出随机游走\n",
    "- Reflexion：把 critic 的 `missing` 改写成下一轮 refiner 可以直接执行的约束\n",
    "\n",
    "**好的 lesson 应该是操作性语句：**\n",
    "\n",
    "- ✅ \"最终答案要包含引用/来源校验，方便用户追踪证据。\"\n",
    "- ❌ \"下次要更仔细地回答。\"\n",
    "- ❌ \"需要更全面。\"\n",
    "\n",
    "`old_lessons` 参数保证跨轮记忆累积，不会丢失之前的教训。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "code-reflect",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "def reflect(critique: Critique, old_lessons: list[str]) -> Reflection:\n",
    "    \"\"\"把 critic 的缺口改写成下一轮可执行的记忆。\"\"\"\n",
    "    # 每个 rubric 维度对应一条操作性约束（而不是空泛建议）\n",
    "    lesson_templates = {\n",
    "        \"grounding\": \"回答 RAG 可靠性问题时，先强调答案必须绑定检索证据。\",\n",
    "        \"citation\":  \"最终答案要包含引用/来源校验，方便用户追踪证据。\",\n",
    "        \"fallback\":  \"检索证据不足时不要硬答，应拒答、追问或触发降级策略。\",\n",
    "        \"evaluation\":\"把离线评估或线上回归写进闭环，避免只靠 prompt 约束。\",\n",
    "        \"concise\":   \"先删泛泛而谈的形容词，保留工程动作。\",\n",
    "    }\n",
    "    lessons = list(old_lessons)     # 复制上一轮记忆，保持累积\n",
    "    for key in critique.missing:\n",
    "        lesson = lesson_templates[key]\n",
    "        if lesson not in lessons:   # 去重，同一教训不重复写入\n",
    "            lessons.append(lesson)\n",
    "    return Reflection(lessons=lessons)\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "# 对初始 critique 进行反思，产出第一批 lessons\n",
    "initial_reflection = reflect(initial_critique, [])  # [] 表示第一轮，没有历史记忆\n",
    "print(\"第 1 轮反思记忆（将传入下一轮 refiner）：\")\n",
    "for lesson in initial_reflection.lessons:\n",
    "    print(\" -\", lesson)\n",
    "print()\n",
    "print(f\"共 {len(initial_reflection.lessons)} 条操作性约束\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "cell-refiner-md",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 7. Refiner —— 读取反思，改写答案\n",
    "\n",
    "Refiner 是 Self-Refine 模式里的"第三个角色"。\n",
    "\n",
    "它的输入是：\n",
    "1. `previous_answer` —— 上一轮的回答\n",
    "2. `reflection.lessons` —— 本轮反思产出的操作性约束\n",
    "\n",
    "**生产中 refiner 的实现方式：**\n",
    "- 把 lessons 拼成约束 prompt，再调一次 LLM\n",
    "- 让 LLM 在 previous_answer 基础上修改，带上 lessons 作为 system prompt\n",
    "\n",
    "离线练习用关键词检测 + 字符串拼接模拟 refiner 行为，确保可复现。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "code-refiner",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "def refine_answer(previous_answer: str, reflection: Reflection) -> str:\n",
    "    \"\"\"模拟 refiner：只根据反思记忆补齐缺口。\"\"\"\n",
    "    # 基础草稿：先满足 grounding 维度\n",
    "    draft = \"降低 RAG Agent 幻觉：先用高召回检索取证据，再让模型只基于证据作答。\"\n",
    "\n",
    "    # 根据 lessons 内容，按需追加对应维度的描述\n",
    "    if any(\"引用\" in lesson or \"来源\" in lesson for lesson in reflection.lessons):\n",
    "        draft += \"输出附引用或证据片段。\"          # 补 citation 维度\n",
    "    if any(\"不足\" in lesson or \"拒答\" in lesson for lesson in reflection.lessons):\n",
    "        draft += \"证据不足时拒答、追问或降级。\"    # 补 fallback 维度\n",
    "    if any(\"评估\" in lesson or \"回归\" in lesson for lesson in reflection.lessons):\n",
    "        draft += \"用 groundedness/faithfulness 回归评估闭环。\"  # 补 evaluation 维度\n",
    "\n",
    "    return draft[:120]  # [:120] 保证 concise 维度始终满足\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "# 基于初始反思生成改进后的答案\n",
    "refined = refine_answer(initial, initial_reflection)\n",
    "print(\"改进后的答案：\")\n",
    "print(\" \", refined)\n",
    "print(f\"字数：{len(refined)} 字\")\n",
    "print()\n",
    "\n",
    "# 再次评判，看分数是否提升\n",
    "refined_critique = critique_answer(refined)\n",
    "print(f\"改进后评分：{refined_critique.score}/5\")\n",
    "print(f\"剩余缺口：  {refined_critique.missing or ['无']}\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "cell-loop-md",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 8. Reflexion 主循环\n",
    "\n",
    "把上面四个组件串联成循环：\n",
    "\n",
    "```\n",
    "answer  = initial_answer\n",
    "lessons = []                             # 跨轮记忆，初始为空\n",
    "\n",
    "for turn in 1..max_turns:\n",
    "    critique   = critic(answer)          # ① 评判\n",
    "    reflection = reflect(critique, lessons)  # ② 反思，累积记忆\n",
    "    record Attempt(turn, answer, critique, reflection)\n",
    "    if score == 5: break                 # ③ 满分，停止\n",
    "    lessons = reflection.lessons         # ④ 更新记忆\n",
    "    answer  = refiner(answer, reflection)# ⑤ 改写\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "**关键：`lessons` 是跨轮累积的，不是每轮重置。**\n",
    "这让第 3 轮的 refiner 能"记住"第 1、2 轮的所有教训。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "code-loop",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "def run_reflexion(task: str = TASK, max_turns: int = 3) -> list[Attempt]:\n",
    "    \"\"\"Reflexion 主循环：生成 → 批判 → 反思 → 改写，直到满分或超出轮次。\"\"\"\n",
    "    answer = generate_initial_answer(task)\n",
    "    lessons: list[str] = []       # 跨轮累积的反思记忆\n",
    "    attempts: list[Attempt] = []\n",
    "\n",
    "    for turn in range(1, max_turns + 1):\n",
    "        critique = critique_answer(answer)\n",
    "        reflection = reflect(critique, lessons)\n",
    "        attempts.append(Attempt(turn, answer, critique, reflection))\n",
    "        lessons = reflection.lessons    # 更新记忆，下一轮 refiner 会读取\n",
    "\n",
    "        if critique.score == 5:\n",
    "            break   # 满分：提前终止，避免无意义循环\n",
    "\n",
    "        answer = refine_answer(answer, reflection)\n",
    "\n",
    "    return attempts\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"run_reflexion 定义完成。\")\n",
    "print(\"返回 list[Attempt]，每个 Attempt 记录一轮的完整轨迹。\")"
   ]
  },
